{"description": "Storybook is the industry standard workshop for building, documenting, and testing UI components in isolation", "homepage": "https://storybook.js.org", "topics": [], "pushed_at": "2026-11-09T22:21:51Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-09T22:53:31Z", "detail": {"avatar": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22632046?v=4", "license": "MIT", "discussions_total": 3003, "latest_release": {"name": "v10.6.6", "tag": "v10.6.6", "published_at": "2026-11-05T16:30:11Z", "body": "## 10.6.6\n\n- Core: Let StackBlitz embed the dev server again - [#37176](https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/37176), thanks @kasperpeulen!\n- Telemetry: Add VRT packages - [#37124](https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/37124), thanks @shilman!\n"}, "hot_issues": [{"number": 14828, "title": "Storybook and angular library: Cannot read property 'selector' of undefined", "comments": 80, "created_at": "2021-05-06T12:42:29Z"}, {"number": 18356, "title": "Support for Astro components", "comments": 69, "created_at": "2022-05-30T05:07:57Z"}, {"number": 12078, "title": "(addon-controls) Support destructering object properties into individual controls", "comments": 57, "created_at": "2020-08-17T11:38:39Z"}, {"number": 22124, "title": "[Bug]:  Hot reload broken in Storybook 7 with Stencil 3.2", "comments": 56, "created_at": "2023-04-17T10:17:43Z"}, {"number": 12006, "title": "Cannot use SB hooks (`useArgs`) in React component rendered inside decorator or render function.", "comments": 47, "created_at": "2020-08-13T22:17:20Z"}, {"number": 11908, "title": "Addon-docs: DocsPage Controls don't update iframe stories", "comments": 46, "created_at": "2020-08-11T23:46:07Z"}, {"number": 34955, "title": "[aw] Code Simplifier failed (pre-agent)", "comments": 45, "created_at": "2026-05-28T13:36:11Z"}, {"number": 30317, "title": "[Bug]: Infinite re-render for async RSC stories", "comments": 45, "created_at": "2025-01-21T01:47:37Z"}], "discussions": [{"number": 37264, "title": "Docs: optional \"Listed on MCPwell\" badge + listing check", "comments": 0, "category": "General", "created_at": "2026-11-08T14:33:54Z"}, {"number": 37127, "title": "Share react/jsx-runtime from the manager so addons can use libraries built with the automatic JSX runtime", "comments": 0, "category": "Ideas", "created_at": "2026-11-03T10:12:32Z"}, {"number": 37112, "title": "Measure and outline: reach into same-origin iframes rendered by a story", "comments": 0, "category": "Ideas", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:26:12Z"}, {"number": 37094, "title": "addon-a11y: re-export axe-core (e.g. @storybook/addon-a11y/axe-core) to scan an opened surface from a test", "comments": 0, "category": "Ideas", "created_at": "2026-10-30T07:40:56Z"}, {"number": 36986, "title": "[@storybook/mcp] Let createStorybookMcpHandler pass options to HttpTransport (e.g. sessionManager)", "comments": 0, "category": "Ideas", "created_at": "2026-10-22T17:01:23Z"}, {"number": 36872, "title": "Any updates on the v10.6.3 release date?", "comments": 1, "category": "General", "created_at": "2026-10-19T10:15:04Z"}, {"number": 36713, "title": "[Feature Request]: Remove css-loader from @storybook/builder-webpack5", "comments": 1, "category": "Ideas", "created_at": "2026-10-10T10:48:07Z"}, {"number": 36626, "title": "Any plans to remove css-loader now that it's archived and deprecated?", "comments": 1, "category": "General", "created_at": "2026-10-06T14:02:31Z"}], "readme_excerpt": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://storybook.js.org/?ref=readme\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/263385/199832481-bbbf5961-6a26-481d-8224-51258cce9b33.png\">\n      <img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/321738/63501763-88dbf600-c4cc-11e9-96cd-94adadc2fd72.png\" alt=\"Storybook\" width=\"400\" />\n    </picture>\n    \n  </a>\n  \n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">Build bulletproof UI components faster</p>\n\n<br/>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://circleci.com/gh/storybookjs/storybook\">\n    <img src=\"https://circleci.com/gh/storybookjs/storybook.svg?style=shield\" alt=\"Build Status on CircleCI\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://codecov.io/gh/storybookjs/storybook\">\n    <img src=\"https://codecov.io/gh/storybookjs/storybook/branch/main/graph/badge.svg\" alt=\"codecov\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/main/LICENSE\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/storybookjs/storybook.svg\" alt=\"License\" />\n  </a>\n  <br/>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/storybook\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/discord-join-7289DA.svg?logo=discord&longCache=true&style=flat\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://storybook.js.org/community/?ref=readme\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/community-join-4BC424.svg\" alt=\"Storybook Community\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"#backers\">\n    <img src=\"https://opencollective.com/storybook/backers/badge.svg\" alt=\"Backers on Open Collective\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"#sponsors\">\n    <img src=\"https://opencollective.com/storybook/tiers/sponsors/badge.svg\" alt=\"Sponsors on Open Collective\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://x.com/intent/follow?screen_name=storybookjs\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/storybookjs?color=blue&logo=twitter\" alt=\"Official Twitter Handle\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://api.securityscorecards.dev/projects/github.com/storybookjs/storybook\">\n    <img src=\"https://api.securityscorecards.dev/projects/github.com/storybookjs/storybook/badge\" alt=\"OpenSSF Scorecard\"/>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\nStorybook is a frontend workshop for building UI components and pages in isolation. Thousands of teams use it for UI development, testing, and documentation. Find out more at <a href=\"https://storybook.js.org/?ref=readme\">storybook.js.org</a>!\n</p>\n\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/storybookjs/storybook/refs/heads/release-6-5/media/storybook-intro.gif\" width=\"100%\" />\n</center>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  View README for:<br/>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/main/README.md\" title=\"latest\"><img alt=\"latest\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/v/@storybook/react/latest?style=for-the-badge&logo=storybook&logoColor=ffffff&color=66BF3C\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/next/README.md\" title=\"next\"><img alt=\"next\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/v/@storybook/react/next?style=for-the-badge&logo=storybook&logoColor=ffffff&color=1EA7FD\" /></"}}